<title>HUNGARY: Hungary one-month T-bill yield rises to 21.31 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary one-month T-bill yield rises to 21.31 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of Hungary's one-month discount Treasury bills was set by auction at 21.31 percent, up from 20.92 percent at auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	1,590.32 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    21.31 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     98.3916 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
